      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Reference is made to the Mayor's Executive Order #11, dated June 8th, 1954. This order outlined the procedure to be followed in submitting proposed State legislation to be included in the City's 1955 legislative program and established October 15th, as the date for submitting such bills to this office.",
